# Supabase

Verify current docs before copying old API shapes. Pin `supabase-js` versions.

- New tables: PK uuid, `timestamptz`, FK indexes, RLS enabled in the same migration.
- Grants: exposing a table to the Data API is separate from RLS. Grant deliberately.
- Storage upsert needs INSERT + SELECT + UPDATE policies.
- Generate types after schema changes; do not hand-write DB row types in apps.
- Local first: `supabase start`, then hosted. Never commit `.env` or the service role.
